# shell: desktop
# AW-065/AW-070/AW-077/AW-078: Get Info is one window per node; its
# permissions apply as they are ticked; its name renames the entry; and it
# closes itself when the entry goes.
note Ctrl+I opens the window the menus have advertised all along
click-row 1
key i ctrl
wait 10
expect-title a.txt info
note asking twice brings the same one forward rather than opening a rival,
note so ONE close is enough to be rid of it
expect-windows 2
note back to the folder window by its TAB, since a click on content is
note deliberately click-through and does not raise
click 80 50
wait 3
key i ctrl
wait 5
expect-windows 2
key w ctrl
wait 5
expect-windows 1
expect-title /tmp/trk_script
note a permission is applied the moment it is ticked, with no OK button
key i ctrl
wait 10
expect-perm /tmp/trk_script/a.txt rw-
click 320 168
wait 3
click 160 240
wait 10
expect-perm /tmp/trk_script/a.txt rwx
note the header renames the entry
click 320 168
wait 3
click 320 133
wait 3
key r
key e
key n
key a
key m
key e
key d
key Return
wait 30
expect-file /tmp/trk_script/renamed
expect-no-file /tmp/trk_script/a.txt
note and the window goes when the entry does
remove /tmp/trk_script/renamed
wait 40
expect-title /tmp/trk_script
quit
